<title>ITALY: Edison H1 1996 profits up 56 percent.</title>
<headline>Edison H1 1996 profits up 56 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30.</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>Cons pretax pre-minorities profit  395  vs 252</p>
<p>    Cons turnover			    920  vs 664</p>
<p>    Net operating profit		   344  vs 206</p>
<p>    Gross operating profit		 454  vs 326</p>
<p>NOTE - Italian energy group Edison, 61.33 percent owned by Montedison, said it expected higher profits at the consolidated and parent company level for the second half of 1996 and for full year 1996 compared to results in the second half of 1995 and in full 1995.</p>
</text>
